    <div class="slide-body">
      <div class="col">
        <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:0.45rem;font-size:0.98rem;">The RGB-only literature (Zhu 2023 review; Liang 2022; Liu 2025) builds biomass regressors on three fixed feature families. This thesis re-implements them as the 97-dimensional baseline benchmarked at both sites.</p>
        <p class="muted" style="font-size:0.82rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--blue);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.08em;">1 · GLCM texture (Haralick et al. 1973)</p>
        <table class="data lit" style="table-layout:auto;">
